{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1565126-forum-closure","id":1565126,"title":"Forum Closure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Onyx Path Announcements"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-11-04T10:29:33-08:00","id":1565126,"title":"Forum Closure","content":"Hello, all.<br /> <br /> We will be shutting down the Onyx Path Forums starting January 2027.<br /> <br /> Please archive any posts and discussions you'd like to save.<br /> <br /> Per Rich in November 2's <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/daze-of-the-dead-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting Notes</a>:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This is a rough decision to make, and it\u2019s something we\u2019ve been reviewing and trying to resolve differently for several years as we\u2019ve kept them going while other TTRPG companies pulled away from forums, but there\u2019s simply not enough activity over there to justify keeping them open.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ll follow up on this in the weeks to come so that we can be sure the word is getting out. Please consider joining us on:<ul><li><b>Discord</b>: <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/eysXevy\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/invite/eysXevy</a></li> <li><b>Reddit</b>: <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/OnyxPathRPG/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.reddit.com/r/OnyxPathRPG/</a></li> <li><b>Bluesky</b>: <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/theonyxpath.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\">https://bsky.app/profile/theonyxpath.bsky.social</a></li> <li><b>Tiktok</b>: <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.tiktok.com/@theonyxpath</a></li> <li><b>YouTube</b>: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/theonyxpath</a></li> <li><b>Facebook</b>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/TheOnyxPath</a></li> <li><b>Twitch</b>: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for spending time with us on the forums, and we hope you'll continue your discussions with us elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-05T10:49:30-08:00","id":1565151,"title":"","content":"It's sad but not shocking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-05T11:18:32-08:00","id":1565153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1565126-forum-closure#post1565126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, all.<br /> <br /> We will be shutting down the Onyx Path Forums starting January 2027.<br /> <br /> Please archive any posts and discussions you'd like to save.<br /> <br /> Per Rich in November 2's <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/daze-of-the-dead-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting Notes</a>:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Thank you for spending time with us on the forums, and we hope you'll continue your discussions with us elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4\" data-vbnamecard=\"4\">IanWatson</a> I am trying to keep all the forum info I enjoyed but it is kind of complex.<br /> <br /> Would you or the owners/administrator be amenable to giving me a copy of the full site, that I maintain in a private server, but it would be a static version: search available but no new posts accepted.<br /> <br /> I do not need the full DB (no need for hashes of passwords) literally just info to make a searchable place full of the old posts. I might, just might be able to afford keeping it accessible and a reasonable access speed (although not highly available).<br /> <br /> I would try to keep all, but if I had to make choices I would keep Chronicles (and subchannels), WoD (and subchannels), Scion, Exalted, everything else would be best effort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-05T15:47:09-08:00","id":1565155,"title":"","content":"Oh no! Sad times! So much stuff got lost and the original WW forums went down. I hope people can salvage this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2801"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-05T17:59:57-08:00","id":1565157,"title":"","content":"I've been with this site for over ten years. It seems unbelievable that it's shutting down. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-06T21:50:38-08:00","id":1565161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1565126-forum-closure?p=1565153#post1565153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4\" data-vbnamecard=\"4\">IanWatson</a> I am trying to keep all the forum info I enjoyed but it is kind of complex.<br /> <br /> Would you or the owners/administrator be amenable to giving me a copy of the full site, that I maintain in a private server, but it would be a static version: search available but no new posts accepted.<br /> <br /> I do not need the full DB (no need for hashes of passwords) literally just info to make a searchable place full of the old posts. I might, just might be able to afford keeping it accessible and a reasonable access speed (although not highly available).<br /> <br /> I would try to keep all, but if I had to make choices I would keep Chronicles (and subchannels), WoD (and subchannels), Scion, Exalted, everything else would be best effort.</div> </div> </div> </div>I second this! I'll be happy to contribute financially to any preservation efforts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28819-arcanum-scholar","name":"Arcanum Scholar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-06T23:48:24-08:00","id":1565162,"title":"","content":"I'm afraid that's not feasible.<br /> <br /> I'm sure there are ways to scrape it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-07T15:35:48-08:00","id":1565172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/1565126-forum-closure?p=1565162#post1565162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm afraid that's not feasible.<br /> <br /> I'm sure there are ways to scrape it.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the first time I've ever seen anyone say &quot;please scrape my forums&quot; but if you insist. I'll give it a shot this evening.<br /> <br /> Updates will be at RPG.net since I don't want to get them lost in the changeover by accident. <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/onyx-path-forums-closing-in-january.939097/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...anuary.939097/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Current project: <a href=\"https://monsterambulance.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Monster Ambulance</a>, wherein you save monsters. In your ambulance.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2240-colin_fredericks","name":"Colin_Fredericks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2240_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"334"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}